	(text "PCB PLACEMENT NOTES:\n- C10 (100nF) at U1 pin 3 (3V3), smallest loop to GND pad.\n- C9 (10uF) next to C10, same 3V3 pin.\n- C11 (1uF) at U1 pin 8 (EN).\n- Keep-out: no copper or parts under/near U1 antenna end."
		(at 15.24 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2e214657-e5d6-4e91-924e-cc0a5fe0f3ad")
	)
	(text "MCU: ESP32-C3-MINI-1-N4. EN RC (R4/C11) for clean reset. GPIO9 = BOOT (SW1 to GND, R5 pull-up).\nStrap pins GPIO2 (status LED, R6 pull-up) and GPIO8 (SDA, R8 I2C pull-up) idle high at boot. GPIO20 spare.\nGPIO21 (U0TXD) drives CAN_S: idles high through boot = transceiver silent."
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2e5b3719-1f76-4df3-ad6b-54819dd2d681")
	)
